$* Synthetic straight-cylinder example; E3D 4.0 runtime unverified.
$* Distances in this sample assume mm working units.
$* Select the intended catalogue owner before running.
NEW PTSET /SAMPLE-PTSET
NEW PTAX
NUM 1
PAXI -Y
PDIS 100
PBOR 80
PCON BWD
END
NEW PTAX
NUM 2
PAXI Y
PDIS 100
PBOR 80
PCON BWD
END
END

NEW GMSET /SAMPLE-GMSET
NEW SCYL
PAXI -Y
PDIS 100
PDIA 89.1
PHEI -200
OBST 2
TUFL TRUE
CLFL FALSE
END
END
